OL,3,GNEWSASale at horse charity is very sad,
OL,4,Asay breeders
OL,5,
OL,6,FHorse breeders have described the
OL,7,Funcertainty surrounding the future of a
OL,8,Fcharity dedicated to protecting a
OL,9,Fcritically endangered breed as "very
OL,10,Fsad".
OL,12,FThe Suffolk Punch Trust announced in
OL,13,FFebruary that it would close its
OL,14,Fvisitor centre, cafe and shop due to
OL,15,Fhigh costs.
OL,17,FIt is now feared the charity may soon
OL,18,Fcease to exist at all, after its
OL,19,F120-acre farm and visitor centre were
OL,20,Fput on the market for #2.4m and the
OL,21,FCharity Commission said it was aware of
OL,22,F"financial concerns".
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
