OL,3,GNEWSASale at horse charity is very sad,
OL,4,Asay breeders
OL,5,
OL,6,FNigel Oakley, former president of the
OL,7,FSuffolk Horse Society, said staff had
OL,8,F"definitely tried their best to keep it
OL,9,Fafloat".
